        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The new release \"Merry\" is priced at 1000 yen. Mail order is planned to start gradually after the new year, so please wait a little m(_ _)m"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "当日は新譜だけではなく、グッズもあります。水玉てんてーカモン！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "当天不仅有新专辑，还有周边。水玉老师快来吧！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On the day there won't just be the new release, but goods too. Mizutama-sensei, come on out!"
